{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o003a","title":"贾诩华歆王朗受任三公","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o003a-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"贾诩华歆王朗受任三公","evidence":["wendi-e-o003a-q"]},{"id":"xunyu-e-o068a-account","label":"《荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十》正文","text":"曹丕任贾诩太尉进爵增邑封贾访任贾穆","evidence":["xunyu-e-o068a-q"]},{"id":"xunyu-a-p055-weilue","label":"《魏略》","text":"《魏略》称文帝德贾诩答嗣，即位首登上司。","evidence":["xunyu-q-p055-weilue"]},{"id":"xunyu-a-p055-xunxu","label":"《荀勖别传》","text":"《荀勖别传》载晋时荀勖谈三公人选，以魏文帝用贾诩而孙权笑之为反例。","evidence":["xunyu-q-p055-xunxu"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0182","role":"任太尉","evidence":["wendi-e-o003a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0340","role":"任相国","evidence":["wendi-e-o003a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0309","role":"任御史大夫","evidence":["wendi-e-o003a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"任用","evidence":["xunyu-e-o068a-q"]},{"person":"xunyu-p0101","role":"受封","evidence":["xunyu-e-o068a-q"]},{"person":"xunyu-p0102","role":"受任","evidence":["xunyu-e-o068a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年二月壬戌","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年二月壬戌"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o003a-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o003a-q","source_order":[2,15,"O003a"],"order":468}],"persons":[{"id":"xunyu-p0101","name":"贾访","evidence":["xunyu-q-o068"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xunyu-m-o068-xunyu-p0101","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-o068"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-o003a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-b85511321b8e2f87b0da","layer":"original","quote":"元年二月，﹝一﹞壬戌〖1〗，以太中大夫贾诩为太尉〖2〗，御史大夫华歆为相国，大理王朗为御史大夫〖3〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":14,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-e-o068a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-c8d48ea2809d2a0c11b5","layer":"original","quote":"文帝即位，以诩为太尉；﹝一﹞进爵魏寿乡侯，增邑三百，并前八百户。又分邑二百，封小子访，为列侯；以长子穆，为驸马都尉。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o068","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-c8d48ea2809d2a0c11b5","layer":"original","quote":"文帝即位，以诩为太尉；﹝一﹞进爵魏寿乡侯，增邑三百，并前八百户。又分邑二百，封小子访，为列侯；以长子穆，为驸马都尉。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p055-weilue","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-65266bf0451e96ffd480","layer":"pei","quote":"文帝德诩之对太祖，故即位，首登上司。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":357,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2619ff16b9ccb1769adc","start":10,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p055-xunxu","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-65266bf0451e96ffd480","layer":"pei","quote":"晋司徒阙，武帝问其人于勖。答曰：‘三公，具瞻所归，不可用非其人。昔魏文帝用贾诩为三公，孙权笑之。","attribution":"《荀勖别传》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":357,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2619ff16b9ccb1769adc","start":38,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
